OL,3,GNEWSABirthday cards pour in for
OL,4,A102-year-old Gwen
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Lincolnshire care home resident has
OL,7,Freceived almost 400 cards from across
OL,8,Fthe world as she celebrated her 102nd
OL,9,Fbirthday on Sunday.
OL,11,FToray Pines care home in Coningsby
OL,12,Flaunched a cards campaign on social
OL,13,Fmedia so that resident Gwen Chapman
OL,14,Fwould have plenty to open on her big
OL,15,Fday.
OL,17,FGwen said the secret to longevity was
OL,18,F"working hard" and "good food plus a
OL,19,Fcup of tea and chocolate."
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
