OL,3,GNEWSABirthday cards pour in for
OL,4,A102-year-old Gwen
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe home said it had organised a party
OL,7,Ffor Gwen's friends, family and fellow
OL,8,Fresidents, who had also been drafted in
OL,9,Fto help open all the cards.
